  "story": {
    "day": 53,
    "title": "After School Choices",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya had a hard day at school.",
      "She finished her social studies class.",
      "Then, she thought about her art club.",
      "Her best friend played badminton.",
      "Many students liked volleyball or table tennis.",
      "Another friend chose track and field.",
      "Kaya remembered her American uncle in California.",
      "He sometimes sent sweet candy.",
      "\"Hey, how are you?\" she wondered.",
      "Kaya was hungry for a sandwich and a radish.",
      "Uh-huh, her aunt sent winter party regards from Hong Kong.",
      "They would have a lot of fun listening to music on Saturday."
    ]
  }
}